This LICENSE covers the container image

    apache/openserverless-runtime-python:v3.13

built by the Dockerfile beside this file. The Apache release artifact is the
SOURCE distribution -- this Dockerfile, requirements.in, requirements.txt and
the files beside them -- all licensed under the Apache License 2.0 above. The
published container image is a CONVENIENCE BINARY that additionally bundles
the third-party components recorded below. Each block names the component, the
license it was released under and its copyright notice. Components requiring
special handling, and the open review items, are recorded in the WARN file
beside this one; WARN is not part of this licensing grant.

